Subject: [PATCH] Compare controlled actors across every activity in snapshot
 diffs

The snapshot comparator only accepted Activity1 player bindings and then
selected the brain UID instead of the controlled actor. Shared inventory
comparison therefore skipped Activity2 and Activity3 and could treat the
wrong actor as local. The detecting tests fail on the previous file and
pass on this one.
